{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa6.u04",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa6.u04",
  "version": 2,
  "content_hash": "9069ef512ad7f94940034ca084d72cf58b1b325ddafd8adc7e9d1228ef38a3ea",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u04.l01",
      "sha256": "882e9b8895b7a871638b848ca8725ad2c7b025dcf915af4f1cf52988fe4fc993"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u04.l02",
      "sha256": "a41984102fe95cb63790043377d941f0eb0f648c9cc7ec665de8151bab1892fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u04.l03",
      "sha256": "4cedbc271eda3533691fbe2a8348070c85017b09d3d9aa16fcb84c4b39de9aaf"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u04.l04",
      "sha256": "f4109876a3e9d68e22eab7e0f0ff360e7b898440d282db3a3b3bd6b3f51d8690"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u04.l05",
      "sha256": "c384f42c69ab0b858ea374e065f72c37c7d54570a0627bec28574412dcfab768"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u04.l06",
      "sha256": "a5971fc9e0d0c53a8767a77f61f5e23af3e7460b1c84c7d88a75324436a978d0"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "057589bf5d0d3bcccf2e9e64614ccb99484306a59fcf1fbe18e6e3f089f2ede8",
      "text": "berlayar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "05a2b18fdc3392469e4aba17d575af5988c407e25d4a5275b6a7960a3f56ccb2",
      "text": "Memang. Setelah Islam datang, orang Melayu menulis dengan aksara Jawi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "07514a8b209d57714a0b184f9d851c9360cd06ebb87fa7d40db1fd57fc6e3fe9",
      "text": "Persis. Biksu dari Tiongkok pun datang belajar di sini.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "07ff89b1223cc4bbce22e935fd2daf4d1d1eb0dc2990b17d264b5a0df98aa223",
      "text": "Konon, pada abad ketujuh, berdirilah sebuah kerajaan besar.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "09397692b44ac0006d51ce868d2429b16b11fd28cfa9563f2c73d40f16723ff0",
      "text": "Batu bertulis itu ditemukan pada tahun 1920.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "093d1bb5c4b97a101ab1060b47a7574cd89e6048ccaa5151aa0b55facbacc7a7",
      "text": "peninggalan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a5ebe83ab604a5a35fda574f39b47c30c5ec2bb6179305382ab5e2f0ef02018",
      "text": "Pada abad pertengahan, berlayarlah para pedagang Arab ke Nusantara.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b11a0010917e99017fbb48e49d7b63eed0d77b91b5d4a66eafc9bffd7fe7463",
      "text": "Kak, aksara Pallawa ini sulit sekali dibaca.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b26c449e68fa6f8086501587358ccc16dc6e1a253c567fcdd6fa6b2e21ff2d7",
      "text": "Sekarang datanglah seorang pelajar dari Mesir. Sejarahnya belum selesai!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 72,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cd43f424b14918adcb467aee6fb063c97e89558c7fe1dc1f16294f730cb9395",
      "text": "pusat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ffc09e192b20a63698bb65cd5e6b14414983811bdf4d501ce5d2f9e6b6a7c6c",
      "text": "Jawi? Itu huruf Arab, kan? Kalau itu, saya bisa membacanya!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1660cee3f9dc51c78f695c13de832f7b9e2f702581dea037fba30a20cdbe5c9e",
      "text": "Pada masa jayanya, Sriwijaya menjadi pusat ilmu agama Buddha.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1af1a9dfca36a022a4bd6ef9cbabdd10c7ef9ed3f62b5d9bade196094ca15ef3",
      "text": "Bahasa di prasasti itu adalah bahasa Melayu Kuno.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1b91aea9f95daba73c040c0bde8aa47d6f5204b8aa298ab88fe3000295135cf6",
      "text": "Lewat jalur itu, cengkih dan pala dari Maluku akhirnya sampai di pelabuhan Iskandariah.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 87,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1fc9f6ba698b66de77360a4d38770f39cc7ab7eb09d38b3b0aa96aadaeabfdc2",
      "text": "Konon, raja pertama datang dari seberang lautan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "21f71a70d19b8e143611dcb559e123bfb6177ed0e19a01e22970cfa40d96ea16",
      "text": "arkeolog",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3370eb45dcad585519ebfb6517d64553598225cd01dafe11d1fdc20dfa98ac5e",
      "text": "pala",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3cd10c80ea30d99ce26acd5b528b4e7162000fb8063827e558403208decf7871",
      "text": "Selat Malaka menjadi pusat perdagangan dunia.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "40c3318f7bcf1a7ff8c3432bf5beebb6dd0a3e712247f9be31619b429acd3373",
      "text": "abad",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4345cf475c620b2606a9824d774b0982da4d7a63b7586f36e6c16af43dda3706",
      "text": "Konon, sejak abad ketujuh, kapal-kapal dari Arab sudah singgah di sini.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 71,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "446785312332869e773d8dc53c9c90c2265fce7901efc1a3501dc9f2c26392bf",
      "text": "Peninggalan kerajaan itu tersimpan di Museum Nasional.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5035aa30de01904a25ebc42057bbd0ef7cfe496b0ec0f1d81dffa26332d7ff40",
      "text": "konon",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5cad4ed5804b7eeaf18c2d8564e815a11d4672c024df5d18fa8f0e3fc6c383a8",
      "text": "Sulit dibayangkan. Dulu di sini berdiri pusat salah satu kerajaan maritim terbesar.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 83,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5fb871c3a32e73359f83e2fb119c5801ead2cd63b523d82a96aa63adf6f3f5fb",
      "text": "Selamat datang di Palembang, Mohamed. Konon, di sungai inilah dulu berdiri Sriwijaya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 85,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "67656287dff7d5ae3c085c27c26ea96439296e6e4ac9ce4dc17cc7905158ad09",
      "text": "jalur",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "67918dbeb6aa56769700ba1204198c4a5b246779409718c329fee4e147d8219c",
      "text": "Kalau begitu, datanglah dua porsi pempek!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "695ff77878c01fb156255a3960d018e17b4bf5951bd7a6b78fd5c9c6b7353774",
      "text": "Jadi Palembang dulu seperti Iskandariah, pusat ilmu dan dagang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6ed58380832f65ac2ddebf138f45d42d30458e0065cc46518be32454adf52662",
      "text": "Jalur laut itu ramai oleh kapal dari berbagai bangsa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "72fff287f38d7e2fb748e6df62572a7062d4c72d6867e8dec7b0ab50e6ae3545",
      "text": "Betul. Karena itu ada kata \"kabar\" di bahasa Indonesia.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7bd488c8cbc057c44b6daa38ae5b7144997a8a13febe3ba2089342a663cd8e4b",
      "text": "garis besar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7c72524e7196de86fbf20b57fe530c719018a91b7a8675d01e55beb4770cab38",
      "text": "kuno",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7f676c42cc176e7b8451f59f424ba7100bf4bc9e4292e5412f7eab58c26f00e3",
      "text": "menguasai",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "835229811fb8b1d23f788f4b2ce60c6b1137146a020e6d7814f1fcd8c6de5af2",
      "text": "Lihat peta ini. Sriwijaya menguasai jalur dari India sampai Tiongkok.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "856bf8b3bc843fb501676c64666d9c87c137643b5a15f4c7779046a530d78a3d",
      "text": "Garis besarnya, Sriwijaya berdiri, berjaya, lalu runtuh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8c7d85616a3d7e273e42cb54f68c6d84cfb3890319ee21d5e53c16b895f7a939",
      "text": "Para arkeolog menemukan aksara kuno di batu itu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8d51f0a6866fd97c911c608e09936e271bf872091589044d4b6bf15eaa64e34d",
      "text": "Pala dari Banda dulu dibawa sampai ke pasar di Kairo.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8f3532c20a5d6027178766e0dc828ed3c2b97ab12e8e73554e262d1d82957824",
      "text": "Dan biksu, pedagang, juga pelaut dari seluruh dunia datang ke sini.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8f392256735a741d457968166fc6ab771e8105d13bec12d34ed553905f535df6",
      "text": "Tulis garis besarnya saja. Tiga peristiwa, secara kronologis.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "91f8a44495023f0c56f34dc1ca7b3ba877af3ae6244df739383e8385c68e71d2",
      "text": "Jalur rempah menghubungkan Maluku dengan Kairo dan Venesia.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "95c1a0e2bd1af4a51f50bf9d3dae33458acd7c9a6d24d9759bc7f632e0c458f0",
      "text": "Ceritakan garis besarnya saja, tidak perlu semua detail.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9858b39cc6a745478abb352ecb269682aab3565a27c035ed835eb6a444c88429",
      "text": "selat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9a81564654e41b75f09a52aa11af829d3f30385f4de56e4cf90884f0e73ca765",
      "text": "kerajaan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9c02ad5353b9ddb5385fc462c00745dc54d0b026db5e6685c06a3f58a8224b48",
      "text": "peristiwa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9ce0e273d94aa1bf22b16ed462189ef6258a286af7097d88b0ebd6b01c3615a1",
      "text": "runtuh",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9fe3310f17015d78bae560e418b7d9f4828da25be9ea473f42e8f99147bd88e9",
      "text": "Masa jaya kerajaan itu berlangsung beberapa abad.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a42b4de9da783d04738562d82e8db949e7c7f8c3f907ac4ae427f59eac7bfa32",
      "text": "kronologis",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a5e60e01ff9465c7e1a940717f6698a1ad65f7d365ac5867ba7488cfdb2b564e",
      "text": "Ha! Adapun pempek, makanan khas kami, itu cerita lain.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a74baa9feb397508a000a614df671e9e248d2b9ebdc15361b20e11931a62a4da",
      "text": "Pada abad ketujuh, berdirilah sebuah kerajaan di tepi Sungai Musi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a877589a38e4b6be433c4d6ba5d8abd76beb32568d12aff9daaba6b81d79bb01",
      "text": "ditemukan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ab387c9a8df6c8e47479ee9d1646a79d1379b1179d03c185d7ed509fd1dd92e9",
      "text": "Pada masa jayanya, kerajaan itu menguasai banyak pelabuhan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "adc400c231a6f131c9c4fbbcca66fc46f222c49d391bad8c51813b354803523c",
      "text": "Kerajaan itu runtuh, tetapi peninggalannya masih ada.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ae2357cd8972544d0ca74dee3600bd38c9d4dbcea14d3aa3b00f08a60748259e",
      "text": "Berdiri pada abad ketujuh, menguasai selat, lalu runtuh pada abad ke-13.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 72,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ae52483afc24f9eeec4520ab78736c4d24eaced8a423a37aa378c2de4a6aceb0",
      "text": "Saya ingin menjadi arkeolog dan meneliti aksara kuno.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "aee51a530f9827dda2daacc225ad5884508388a2a9b24b9a0971c872ecf0327b",
      "text": "aksara",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b015e09f7f71717b399ee46f8d1ca252fc03872438e40ec4aa511e95997ef326",
      "text": "Kalimat Kak Dewi seperti buku sejarah! \"Berdirilah sebuah kerajaan …\"",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b02daf173ada0692b5b93159969092ac312eb349aae6931cf0de59aad10e3f19",
      "text": "Pusat kerajaan itu berada di tepi Sungai Musi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b06bebc427fae2f85703b79012d6a8e0517821b8dcb9eb561668891bbce400b2",
      "text": "Bagus! Jadi jalur rempah juga jalur bahasa dan agama, ya?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b59c7a2c7ff5fe3437e1dff25bc26a74e5e736ed1b03fac97a0c26933c033006",
      "text": "Kerajaan yang kuat pun akhirnya bisa runtuh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bab8624014aa1c8668b9deb61e0ddb90d4beeb55da038475325c53d49de7d436",
      "text": "prasasti",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bcc422150d00b27a1f70e4702ca7f7734a5026743f38759e890102b70261ffe5",
      "text": "cengkih",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c1a01bc478e8434886bec19018de0555c874879e9d45e6dd49cbb1c77d4e907c",
      "text": "biksu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c65528a12f42dff0d19f63345bf886fa640d92ee1b27a7144b15d9fab30ec8ed",
      "text": "Sempurna. Tambahkan satu kalimat tentang peninggalannya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c78a5b9e9b1a64bd6b0c3c385394211f007cfc09c2f860c1f0480ac47803a08f",
      "text": "Dari jembatan ini, kita bisa melihat seluruh Sungai Musi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cb400749d059037be3c00a55ada7edfb221b69f5af3ed8796b784e38dcf65120",
      "text": "Kak, ringkasan saya terlalu panjang. Tiga halaman tentang Sriwijaya!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cdbc71cb1212006b7680ccec85ceaa87a512478aaaf49ea7fc7a92e74027bf0f",
      "text": "Para arkeolog meneliti batu kuno itu selama bertahun-tahun.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ed08580afa437802cebf505b3cc048b990d1aa5029d7ebbc4c4f9e738147fe40",
      "text": "masa jaya",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f0701ac90111fdf3cd71dc660c5e219f2031a439e618d5f7d32ec7faa9b1d0fa",
      "text": "Bisa membaca hurufnya, tetapi bahasanya Melayu. Coba nanti di museum.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f8a0fe5d751b0154f81049742c63bceff0cdc0019b37ea252ac5486cc272ccb2",
      "text": "Sayang sekali kerajaan sebesar itu runtuh.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
